@1 = ~The food here is disgusting. I have a sweet tooth, and I prefer something sweet. If I could add a little honey to this dreadful beer, perhaps eat a few cookies, I might finally satisfy that craving.~
@2 = ~I have some cookies. Will you pay 17 gold for it?~
@3 = ~I have some honey. Will you pay 34 gold for it?~
@4 = ~I hope you find something more appetizing.~
